("v199", "key", "children")
("v200", "type", "Sequence")
("v201", "type", "String")
("v201", "scalar", "My reading of the pattern is that the joke exposes a mismatch between argumentative sophistication and the relationship in which the argument occurs. Questions about uncertainty, incentives, and evidence can be perfectly legitimate. Their legitimacy does not automatically determine who may set the terms of a dispute, what a damaged relationship requires, or whether another person must remain present while an explanation is completed. A valid concept can be used within an invalid claim to authority.")
("v200", "item", "v201")
("v199", "value", "v200")
("v151", "item", "v194")
("v202", "type", "String")
("v202", "scalar", "\n")
("v151", "item", "v202")
("v203", "type", "Record")
("v203", "entry", "v204")
("v204", "type", "Entry")
("v204", "key", "tag")
("v205", "type", "String")
("v205", "scalar", "p")
("v204", "value", "v205")
("v203", "entry", "v206")
("v206", "type", "Entry")
("v206", "key", "attrs")
("v207", "type", "Record")
("v206", "value", "v207")
("v203", "entry", "v208")
("v208", "type", "Entry")
("v208", "key", "children")
("v209", "type", "Sequence")
("v210", "type", "String")
("v210", "scalar", "That is the negative space the satire makes visible. Something is absent from the speaker's model, but the omission does not look like an ordinary missing variable. It concerns what kind of encounter this is. A person reporting a broken promise may be asking for acknowledgment, restitution, changed behavior, or distance. Requiring that person to first establish a universal theory of moral character changes the subject and transfers the burden. The argument can become a device for making a concrete obligation indefinitely unavailable.")
("v209", "item", "v210")
("v208", "value", "v209")
("v151", "item", "v203")
("v211", "type", "String")
("v211", "scalar", "\n")
("v151", "item", "v211")
("v212", "type", "Record")
("v212", "entry", "v213")
("v213", "type", "Entry")
("v213", "key", "tag")
("v214", "type", "String")
("v214", "scalar", "p")
("v213", "value", "v214")
("v212", "entry", "v215")
("v215", "type", "Entry")
("v215", "key", "attrs")
("v216", "type", "Record")
("v215", "value", "v216")
("v212", "entry", "v217")
("v217", "type", "Entry")
("v217", "key", "children")
("v218", "type", "Sequence")
("v219", "type", "String")
("v219", "scalar", "The distinction matters because intellectual error is only one possible explanation for this maneuver. Sometimes the speaker misunderstands a method. Sometimes the method is internally coherent and deployed selectively. Sometimes the principal problem is that the speaker controls the agenda, the admissible evidence, and the point at which discussion ends. Better reasoning may help with the first problem. The latter problems also require attention to authority and power.")
("v218", "item", "v219")
("v217", "value", "v218")
("v151", "item", "v212")
("v220", "type", "String")
("v220", "scalar", "\n")
("v151", "item", "v220")
