("v410", "type", "String")
("v410", "scalar", "Suppose, however, that an appropriate response differs between those situations. One apparent agreement was freely given; the other followed a credible threat to withdraw essential support. A report that records only agreement cannot distinguish them. It is insufficient for that decision, even if it measures agreement without error. For a linear observation map, the invisible differences lie in its kernel. For an actual social setting, observations are usually more complicated, but the basic question survives: which differences does this description erase?")
("v409", "item", "v410")
("v408", "value", "v409")
("v151", "item", "v403")
("v411", "type", "String")
("v411", "scalar", "\n")
("v151", "item", "v411")
