("v435", "scalar", "The obvious next move is to build a framework that includes the missing things. Add relationship, embodiment, local knowledge, vulnerability, particular obligations, repair, and the perspective of the person who bears the cost. Such a framework may be an improvement. It also develops its own characteristic evasions.")
