("v656", "type", "Sequence")
("v657", "type", "String")
("v657", "scalar", "This is an invented example, not an additional claim about the satire site. Its purpose is to make the next negative space visible. A framework can acknowledge emotion and remain unable to acknowledge coercion. It can celebrate situated knowledge while reserving the power to decide whose situation counts. It can speak fluently about repair while making support contingent on reconciliation. Recognizing a missing category does not settle who controls its application.")
("v656", "item", "v657")
("v655", "value", "v656")
("v427", "item", "v650")
("v658", "type", "String")
("v658", "scalar", "\n")
("v427", "item", "v658")
("v659", "type", "Record")
("v659", "entry", "v660")
("v660", "type", "Entry")
("v660", "key", "tag")
("v661", "type", "String")
("v661", "scalar", "p")
("v660", "value", "v661")
("v659", "entry", "v662")
("v662", "type", "Entry")
("v662", "key", "attrs")
("v663", "type", "Record")
("v662", "value", "v663")
("v659", "entry", "v664")
("v664", "type", "Entry")
("v664", "key", "children")
("v665", "type", "Sequence")
("v666", "type", "String")
("v666", "scalar", "We might then combine the intellectual and relational frameworks, give both a standing critique, and establish procedures for correction. Yet the procedures themselves become a new location of power. Someone chooses the reviewers. Someone funds them. Someone defines what constitutes a valid complaint. Someone decides whether a case is urgent, whether a witness is credible, whether a disagreement is substantive, and whether a correction has been adequately received.")
("v665", "item", "v666")
("v664", "value", "v665")
("v427", "item", "v659")
("v667", "type", "String")
("v667", "scalar", "\n")
("v427", "item", "v667")
("v668", "type", "Record")
("v668", "entry", "v669")
("v669", "type", "Entry")
("v669", "key", "tag")
("v670", "type", "String")
("v670", "scalar", "p")
("v669", "value", "v670")
("v668", "entry", "v671")
("v671", "type", "Entry")
("v671", "key", "attrs")
("v672", "type", "Record")
("v671", "value", "v672")
("v668", "entry", "v673")
("v673", "type", "Entry")
("v673", "key", "children")
("v674", "type", "Sequence")
("v675", "type", "String")
("v675", "scalar", "An institution can become remarkably skilled at receiving criticism without allowing criticism to change any allocation of resources or authority. Its leaders may publish thoughtful reflections on their limitations. Its annual report may include a sophisticated account of capture. Its complaint form may explain that the institution understands the danger of complaint forms. None of this establishes that an affected person can obtain a remedy against the institution's preference.")
("v674", "item", "v675")
("v673", "value", "v674")
