("v683", "type", "Sequence")
("v684", "type", "String")
("v684", "scalar", "A statement of self-awareness provides little evidence about who can obtain a remedy. A more demanding test is whether correction can impose a cost the system did not choose: a payment, a loss of discretion, a changed appointment, an adverse record, an external review, or the departure of someone it wanted to retain. Even these tests require judgment. An institution can manufacture token losses to advertise openness. The relevant question concerns the actual allocation of power in a specific dispute.")
("v683", "item", "v684")
("v682", "value", "v683")
