("v719", "type", "Sequence")
("v720", "type", "String")
("v720", "scalar", "The old arrangement is already compromised. That is crucial to the pattern we can draw from it. The people are not simply exchanging an immaculate order for a corrupt one. They have a grievance against the existing administration. The warning about their proposed remedy does not make that grievance imaginary. A critique that forgets the opening failure can become an argument for leaving unjust authority undisturbed.")
("v719", "item", "v720")
("v718", "value", "v719")
