("v728", "type", "Sequence")
("v729", "type", "String")
("v729", "scalar", "Equally, the reality of the grievance does not establish the safety of the proposed replacement. A remedy can solve a problem and acquire capacities that generate another. Central coordination may make adjudication more consistent or defense more effective. The resources needed for those functions may also sustain a court, reward loyal supporters, and raise the price of opposition. What is gained at one point in the network can change the options available elsewhere.")
("v728", "item", "v729")
("v727", "value", "v728")
