("v738", "scalar", "The mathematical reading developed in The Field concerns that transfer. It asks what happens when households delegate resource powers to an office, become dependent on services associated with it, suffer contested taking, seek review, and attempt to enforce a withdrawal of authority. The passage supplies the scenario's moral and political tension. It does not supply the numerical coefficients, the cooperation curves, a review constitution, or the counterfactual interventions. Those are authored research assumptions, available for rejection. (")
