("v902", "type", "Sequence")
("v903", "type", "String")
("v903", "scalar", "One can see why revocation must be more than a sentence. An office may lose its formal warrant while retaining soldiers, money, records, infrastructure, and beneficiaries. A household may possess the right to object while lacking the resources to survive an interruption in service. A reviewer may issue a finding while no one can make the office comply. The model therefore separates authority that is claimed, authority that is treated as authorized within a declared scope, and effective material power.")
("v902", "item", "v903")
("v901", "value", "v902")
