("v912", "scalar", "Nested authority intensifies this problem. A community may authorize an office to administer a resource. The office may delegate a narrower task. That delegate may hire a further agent. Legitimate nesting requires limits to travel with the delegation. A power to distribute grain does not automatically become a power to silence complaints about grain. A power to teach does not automatically become a power to control housing. A power to review one decision does not create authority over the critic's whole life.")
("v911", "item", "v912")
("v910", "value", "v911")
