("v921", "scalar", "The model's practical language is a scoped grant: a holder, a domain, a permitted action, a quantitative or procedural limit, a delegator, and conditions of review and revocation. Descendant grants do not become broader by being further from their source. This gives us a precise question to ask of a chain: which permissions were actually transmitted, and which powers were merely accumulated?")
("v920", "item", "v921")
("v919", "value", "v920")
("v895", "item", "v914")
