("v1010", "scalar", "The value of a biblical blueprint is therefore neither an algorithm that decides every dispute nor an ornament placed above an already completed argument. A narrative preserves recognizable relations among fear, grievance, imitation, trust, delegation, ambition, and consequence. It may make an arrangement legible before anyone has a measurement scheme for it. The analytical task is to specify which pattern is being proposed, distinguish interpretation from observation, and allow the interpretation to be challenged.")
("v1009", "item", "v1010")
("v1008", "value", "v1009")
