("v1028", "type", "String")
("v1028", "scalar", "That relinquishment can be ordinary and specific. An office accepts a review it does not control. A leader's term ends. A donor pays without purchasing gratitude. An institution returns resources without requiring a favorable narrative. A person may decline reconciliation while retaining standing. These actions do not establish holiness, and the model does not score them as such. They make claims about service vulnerable to events outside the claimant's preferred interpretation.")
("v1027", "item", "v1028")
("v1026", "value", "v1027")
