("v1044", "scalar", "A person may rely on an institution’s competence while doubting its honesty. They may trust a friend with a secret while refusing a business arrangement. They may depend on a provider whom they do not trust at all. A useful account needs to preserve those differences.")
("v1043", "item", "v1044")
("v1042", "value", "v1043")
