("v1062", "type", "String")
("v1062", "scalar", "An indexed array with these dimensions can resemble a tensor. Multilayer network theory supplies established mathematical tools for representing several kinds of connection among the same nodes. That is a relevant representational precedent, not evidence that interpersonal trust behaves like a physical force. Nor does attaching more indices establish a coordinate-invariant geometric tensor or a valid psychological measurement. The simpler description, until those further claims are earned, is a structured array of attributed relational estimates. (")
("v1061", "item", "v1062")
