("v1093", "type", "String")
("v1093", "scalar", "The attribution matters. A trust estimate is someone else's description, potentially disputed by the person described. Unknown must remain distinguishable from zero. Silence must remain distinguishable from agreement. Compliance must remain distinguishable from trust. Office must not automatically transmit personal credibility. Reciprocity and transitivity cannot be silently assumed: the fact that I trust you and you trust a third person does not settle what I should entrust to them.")
("v1092", "item", "v1093")
("v1091", "value", "v1092")
