("v1110", "type", "Sequence")
("v1111", "type", "String")
("v1111", "scalar", "The Field therefore does not average human standing, holiness, care, agency, forgiveness, or moral worth. Material stocks, particular expectations, and costs of a specified route can be modeled under explicit assumptions. The person remains more than those quantities. A measurement of the cost of leaving is not a measurement of the value of the person who leaves.")
("v1110", "item", "v1111")
("v1109", "value", "v1110")
