("v1119", "type", "Sequence")
("v1120", "type", "String")
("v1120", "scalar", "To make the relational picture dynamic, we need to distinguish a state from an event. A state records what resources, permissions, dependencies, and attributed expectations currently exist. An event changes some of them: a delegation is issued, a promise is broken, a hearing is held, resources are returned. The next event takes place in the conditions left by the previous one. This sounds elementary, but it prevents a common modeling shortcut in which each branch receives a scripted moral outcome.")
("v1119", "item", "v1120")
("v1118", "value", "v1119")
("v1036", "item", "v1113")
