("v1156", "scalar", "The correction margin is a useful way to express the material part. Let R be resources available for a specified review route, h the cost of a hearing, P the patronage stock, b the multiplier connecting patronage to required enforcement resources, s a switching-cost coefficient, A alternative-service assets, and d_g dependence for each group. In the current synthetic model, a financial margin has the form:")
