("v1489", "scalar", "The formula makes each modeled burden inspectable. Hearing costs consume resources. Patronage increases resistance. Dependence raises the replacement burden. Alternatives reduce that burden under the stipulated functional form. These terms share benchmark material units only because the conversion coefficients are explicitly part of the model. They are not interchangeable expressions of justice.")
