("v1506", "type", "Sequence")
("v1507", "type", "String")
("v1507", "scalar", "Financial and coordination margins form a vector, not a combined moral grade. Enough money cannot numerically compensate for an absent coalition in a route that requires collective action. Strong peer relationships cannot buy an enforcement resource that does not exist. Evidence access, jurisdiction, reviewer independence, physical safety, and continuity of essential services can also fail. The present numerical intervention comparison does not dynamically model every one of these gates. A positive pair of margins remains a conditional result within the specified route.")
("v1506", "item", "v1507")
("v1505", "value", "v1506")
