("v2137", "scalar", "As dependence approaches one, total cooperation approaches one under both rules, regardless of the remaining voluntary component. This formalizes a particular possibility: someone can keep complying because alternatives have disappeared. The equation does not diagnose any real relationship. It shows why behavior alone cannot safely carry the interpretation we often place upon it.")
