("v2411", "type", "String")
("v2411", "scalar", "At complete dependence the gap vanishes. A setting of near-universal compliance may therefore be precisely where these rules are hardest to distinguish. Before interpreting obedience as confidence in authority, we need independent evidence about outside options and expectations. Otherwise the institution's power to constrain behavior becomes evidence for the quality of the relationship it constrains.")
("v2410", "item", "v2411")
("v2409", "value", "v2410")
