("v2474", "scalar", "Uncertainty therefore belongs inside the analysis from the beginning. The current exercise varies six quantities: the shared fallback, each group's initial dependence, hearing cost, the multiplier connecting patronage to blocking resources, and a switching-cost coefficient. The ranges are illustrative. The dependence intervals remain separate for the established and less-protected groups. The uncertainty set has no attached probability distribution and does not claim statistical independence among its coordinates. (")
