("v2494", "scalar", "Each selected parameter tuple and cooperation law stays fixed throughout its trajectory while resources, evidence, dependence, and grants evolve. The same tuple is paired across the two rules and across interventions. This preserves the comparison's shared uncertainty; it does not introduce fresh random errors at every period or represent every kind of disturbance an institution could experience.")
("v2493", "item", "v2494")
("v2492", "value", "v2493")
