("v2503", "scalar", "Across those ranges, every nominal first-hearing conclusion becomes fragile. In case A, the linear financial margin spans approximately −0.132 to +0.167; the quadratic margin spans −0.187 to +0.119. In case B, the corresponding intervals are approximately −0.208 to +0.208 and −0.375 to +0.064. Each interval crosses zero. The declared first-period coordination margins remain positive. The unresolved question at that point is financial enforcement, rather than an initial failure of peer coordination.")
