("v2885", "type", "String")
("v2885", "scalar", "The time dimension then becomes unavoidable. A margin of +0.1 can describe a stable reserve or a rapidly disappearing opportunity. A margin of −0.1 can describe entrenched blockage or a deficit that is shrinking. The level tells us where the route stands relative to its declared requirement. The rate tells us something about its direction. Neither gives a complete causal explanation.")
("v2884", "item", "v2885")
("v2883", "value", "v2884")
