("v3390", "type", "String")
("v3390", "scalar", "There is a separate warning when the lower coordination assessment approaches its own floor ε_q. The current comparison uses 0.05 for each floor, but their units differ. Equal numerical values do not make them the same quantity. Their selection is a contestable design responsibility, not a scientific discovery about how much freedom a person should have.")
("v3389", "item", "v3390")
