("v3399", "type", "String")
("v3399", "scalar", "This projected warning is a heuristic. The rate of a conservative bound is the rate of an assessment, not a certified bound on the actual trajectory's derivative. A lower assessment can move because new evidence changes the admitted possibilities. A linear projection can miss a sudden retaliation, an exhausted budget, or a threshold event. The warning helps organize attention and compare responses. It cannot establish an entitlement to interfere.")
("v3398", "item", "v3399")
("v3397", "value", "v3398")
