("v3415", "key", "children")
("v3416", "type", "Sequence")
("v3417", "type", "String")
("v3417", "scalar", "This is closely related to The Field's third consequence order. An action has immediate effects on resources and outcomes. It can also change relationships and expectations. Beyond those, it can change the practical strategies available later: who can object, what alliances can form, what authority can be withdrawn, what alternatives can be used. The third order concerns these future institutional possibilities. It is not a third time derivative.")
("v3416", "item", "v3417")
("v3415", "value", "v3416")
