("v3425", "type", "Sequence")
("v3426", "type", "String")
("v3426", "scalar", "Consider an office that provides an effective service and gradually becomes indispensable. Today's service can improve life while tomorrow's ability to challenge the provider deteriorates. Consider a successful complaint that consumes the complainants' reserve. Today's ruling can be favorable while the next complaint becomes infeasible. Consider a reconciliation process that restores public confidence without returning resources. Today's atmosphere can become calmer while dependence deepens. The time path of correction capacity helps expose these possibilities without collapsing them into one verdict about whether the intervention was good.")
("v3425", "item", "v3426")
("v3424", "value", "v3425")
