("v3441", "type", "Sequence")
("v3442", "type", "String")
("v3442", "scalar", "The recent intervention comparison makes the distinction concrete. Seven policies receive the same separate support endowment of two material tokens. One leaves it unused. A bridge funds the present hearing. A reserve funds the present hearing and capacity for another. Another policy spends on alternatives alone. A staged policy protects the reserve first and spends what remains on alternatives. Two further policies apply staged support only after observed erosion, or deliver it two periods after the warning. Every gift has a payer, and no account can spend money it does not have. (")
("v3441", "item", "v3442")
