("v3462", "type", "String")
("v3462", "scalar", "The controller does not receive the hidden true cooperation law or the actual dependence and cost values used by a simulated trajectory. It receives audited stocks, past public events, and declared bounds. Its response therefore has to work with an information state resembling the problem it is meant to address. A policy that secretly knows the correct future at each branch could look prudent without being implementable by an actual observer.")
("v3461", "item", "v3462")
("v3460", "value", "v3461")
