("v3476", "value", "v3477")
("v3473", "entry", "v3478")
("v3478", "type", "Entry")
("v3478", "key", "children")
("v3479", "type", "Sequence")
("v3480", "type", "String")
("v3480", "scalar", "The primary test is deliberately stronger than securing one favorable ruling. Throughout a horizon of 12 synthetic periods, enough resources must remain after every period for a hypothetical further hearing at that same state, and coordination must remain above its separate floor. This is immediately available spare capacity. It is not a forecast of the next period and does not include another taking or a fresh donor gift. The report separately records recovery after delivery, because late help can restore capacity without undoing the earlier gap.")
("v3479", "item", "v3480")
