("v3865", "type", "Sequence")
("v3866", "type", "String")
("v3866", "scalar", "The zeros need careful reading. A bridge succeeds in enforcing every first challenge. It fails the stronger test because another hearing is not already funded afterward. Unspent donor resources remain available for a possible later gift, but the gift is contingent. A missing institutional reserve does not prove every future challenge would fail. It exposes a difference between capacity already held and help still dependent on another actor's decision.")
("v3865", "item", "v3866")
("v3864", "value", "v3865")
("v3434", "item", "v3859")
("v3867", "type", "String")
("v3867", "scalar", "\n")
("v3434", "item", "v3867")
("v3868", "type", "Record")
("v3868", "entry", "v3869")
("v3869", "type", "Entry")
("v3869", "key", "tag")
("v3870", "type", "String")
("v3870", "scalar", "p")
("v3869", "value", "v3870")
("v3868", "entry", "v3871")
("v3871", "type", "Entry")
("v3871", "key", "attrs")
("v3872", "type", "Record")
("v3871", "value", "v3872")
("v3868", "entry", "v3873")
("v3873", "type", "Entry")
("v3873", "key", "children")
("v3874", "type", "Sequence")
("v3875", "type", "String")
("v3875", "scalar", "The two immediate reserve policies retain both floors throughout the entire finite design. The reserve-only policy's lowest observed financial margin is approximately +0.071, and its lowest coordination margin approximately +0.215. Staged support raises those minima to approximately +0.167 and +0.309. Each exceeds its declared 0.05 floor. These extrema belong to the tested trajectories; they are not interval certificates for every continuous point.")
("v3874", "item", "v3875")
("v3873", "value", "v3874")
("v3434", "item", "v3868")
("v3876", "type", "String")
("v3876", "scalar", "\n")
("v3434", "item", "v3876")
("v3877", "type", "Record")
("v3877", "entry", "v3878")
("v3878", "type", "Entry")
("v3878", "key", "tag")
("v3879", "type", "String")
("v3879", "scalar", "p")
("v3878", "value", "v3879")
("v3877", "entry", "v3880")
("v3880", "type", "Entry")
("v3880", "key", "attrs")
("v3881", "type", "Record")
("v3880", "value", "v3881")
("v3877", "entry", "v3882")
("v3882", "type", "Entry")
("v3882", "key", "children")
("v3883", "type", "Sequence")
("v3884", "type", "String")
("v3884", "scalar", "The comparison is also not free of cost. Reserve support spends approximately 0.73 to 1.01 of the two-token endowment and leaves the remainder unused. Staged support spends that remainder on alternatives. Its additional slack therefore uses more actual resources, even though both policies begin with the same available budget. Changes in service delivery have both signs in the matched comparison. Reduced taking and preserved challenge capacity do not mean that every valued outcome improves.")
("v3883", "item", "v3884")
("v3882", "value", "v3883")
("v3434", "item", "v3877")
("v3885", "type", "String")
("v3885", "scalar", "\n")
("v3434", "item", "v3885")
("v3886", "type", "Record")
("v3886", "entry", "v3887")
("v3887", "type", "Entry")
("v3887", "key", "tag")
("v3888", "type", "String")
("v3888", "scalar", "p")
("v3887", "value", "v3888")
("v3886", "entry", "v3889")
("v3889", "type", "Entry")
("v3889", "key", "attrs")
("v3890", "type", "Record")
("v3889", "value", "v3890")
("v3886", "entry", "v3891")
("v3891", "type", "Entry")
("v3891", "key", "children")
("v3892", "type", "Sequence")
("v3893", "type", "String")
("v3893", "scalar", "Timing is especially consequential. Waiting for a negative assessment rate often restores the floors once support arrives, but the initial loss of spare capacity remains. A two-period delay leaves some trajectories with funding shortfalls or damaged coordination. In case A, 231 delayed trajectories end in the modeled capture condition despite every delayed A trajectory having experienced enforcement at least once.")
("v3892", "item", "v3893")
("v3891", "value", "v3892")
("v3434", "item", "v3886")
