("v3895", "entry", "v3900")
("v3900", "type", "Entry")
("v3900", "key", "children")
("v3901", "type", "Sequence")
("v3902", "type", "String")
("v3902", "scalar", "One witness is particularly clear. The quadratic-rule trajectory receives support and enforces withdrawal in period 3. Its financial margin is then positive, but its coordination margin is negative. In period 5, the common delegation rule issues a fresh resource grant and capture resumes. No script announces that repair must fail. The renewed blockage emerges from the state left behind by the delayed response.")
("v3901", "item", "v3902")
("v3900", "value", "v3901")
