("v3955", "scalar", "The local research run records the calculations and premises, and 82 scoped tests check the model family and this extension. Those checks establish that the research code executes its assumptions consistently in the tested ways. They do not calibrate the assumptions, confirm a theology, or provide independent evidence that a real institution will follow the same path.")
