("v4220", "type", "String")
("v4220", "scalar", "An observer does not know all of x_t or θ. What it has is an information state: the histories and possibilities still compatible with the evidence. Call that set B_t. A defensible intervention policy must choose its action from B_t and the observed history. It cannot choose one action for the linear rule and another for the quadratic rule while pretending it does not know which rule applies.")
