("v4591", "scalar", "This is a proposed way to pose the robust viability problem. The current implementation compares seven specified policies and gives the narrower conditional argument already described. It does not compute these full sets for arbitrary interventions. In particular, the spare-capacity test does not establish that an endless sequence of costly hearings can be sustained. A reserve that has never been spent is a different mathematical object from a renewable institution.")
("v4590", "item", "v4591")
("v4589", "value", "v4590")
