("v4629", "scalar", "If no action within the budget and delegated scope preserves the required conditions, the result should be infeasibility. It should identify the unmet resource, time, or coordination requirement. Silently lowering the floor until a favored intervention passes would turn the correction apparatus into self-justification. Changing a floor may sometimes be warranted, but the original failure and the reason for the new standard must remain available.")
("v4628", "item", "v4629")
("v4627", "value", "v4628")
