("v4645", "type", "String")
("v4645", "scalar", "This gives scenario modeling a more disciplined role in questions such as injustice, failure of repair, nepotism, identity favoritism, and coddling. Those words should enter as contested descriptions of specific patterns. Treating them as numerical essences would reproduce the very problem the framework is trying to avoid. We need to say what happened, who had which authority, what obligation existed, what resources changed hands, what alternatives were available, and which account is disputed.")
("v4644", "item", "v4645")
("v4643", "value", "v4644")
