("v4701", "type", "String")
("v4701", "scalar", "For a failure-of-repair scenario, the question might be whether an apology changes any material stock, whether restitution reaches the affected person, whether the behavior stops, and whether authority is restored before those conditions hold. A public account of learning can be recorded as speech. It need not be treated as a transfer of resources or evidence that the injured person now feels safe. Repair can be partial, refused, or incomplete without requiring the model to decide whether forgiveness has occurred.")
("v4700", "item", "v4701")
("v4699", "value", "v4700")
