("v4747", "type", "String")
("v4747", "scalar", "For an identity-favoritism scenario, unequal treatment requires careful interpretation. A remedy for a documented barrier and an arbitrary privilege can produce different allocations for different groups while having different reasons and effects. The model should preserve starting conditions, declared purposes, actual access, procedural standing, and the views of affected people. A requirement of identical allocations can conceal an existing asymmetry; an appeal to historic asymmetry can also be used to excuse an unreviewable preference. Neither description should get the answer by definition.")
("v4746", "item", "v4747")
("v4745", "value", "v4746")
