("v4808", "scalar", "Outside challenge creates the next difficulty. A protected support fund looks like a solution because it can finance a complaint against the resource-holding office. But what if the fund's donor acquires the power to decide which complaints deserve support? What if beneficiaries must display gratitude, disclose intimate details, adopt a vocabulary, or participate in public reconciliation? The system may have transferred dependence rather than reduced its capacity for coercion.")
("v4807", "item", "v4808")
("v4806", "value", "v4807")
