("v4956", "scalar", "The current model assumes protected funds and authorized resource gifts. It does not prove donor independence. A later model of donor capture would need to represent the conditions of support, withdrawal powers, conflicts of interest, information demands, and the practical ability to challenge the donor. Adding those variables might defeat the favorable result. That would be a meaningful correction, not an embarrassment to be absorbed into a larger claim of foresight.")
("v4955", "item", "v4956")
("v4954", "value", "v4955")
("v4800", "item", "v4949")
