("v4964", "type", "Sequence")
("v4965", "type", "String")
("v4965", "scalar", "There are practical institutional ideas worth testing here: multiple funding sources, limited eligibility conditions, separation between support and adjudication, portable records, fixed terms, transparent conflicts, and routes that do not require the institution's permission. None is sufficient by itself. Several nominal funders may share one controlling interest. An independent reviewer may depend on the same employer. Portable records can spread an error more effectively. Transparency can expose a complainant while leaving a powerful actor untouched.")
("v4964", "item", "v4965")
("v4963", "value", "v4964")
("v4800", "item", "v4958")
("v4966", "type", "String")
("v4966", "scalar", "\n")
