("v4970", "type", "Entry")
("v4970", "key", "attrs")
("v4971", "type", "Record")
("v4970", "value", "v4971")
("v4967", "entry", "v4972")
("v4972", "type", "Entry")
("v4972", "key", "children")
("v4973", "type", "Sequence")
("v4974", "type", "String")
("v4974", "scalar", "The right to challenge also has to extend beyond the terms of the diagnostic. Someone may dispute the estimated dependence, the importance of a particular service, the selected uncertainty set, or the model's account of authority. They may simply say that they do not want this relationship and do not wish to provide more data. A low estimated margin must not become a reason to remove their discretion on the grounds that they are insufficiently able to exercise it.")
("v4973", "item", "v4974")
("v4972", "value", "v4973")
("v4800", "item", "v4967")
