("v4981", "type", "Entry")
("v4981", "key", "children")
("v4982", "type", "Sequence")
("v4983", "type", "String")
("v4983", "scalar", "This is where the scope of the intervention matters as much as its intention. An authorized grant of resources can enlarge an option. Taking control of a person's decisions because a model predicts that they need help is a further exercise of authority, requiring a separate warrant. The warning equation supplies no such warrant. A research diagnostic should not smuggle a jurisdictional claim into its output.")
("v4982", "item", "v4983")
("v4981", "value", "v4982")
