("v4990", "key", "children")
("v4991", "type", "Sequence")
("v4992", "type", "String")
("v4992", "scalar", "This produces the recursion. If the framework needs correction, the correction mechanism needs correction. Its funding and membership need scrutiny. The scrutinizers need scrutiny. A sufficiently ambitious theory might try to include every level until the whole structure becomes a perfect diagram of its own possible corruption.")
("v4991", "item", "v4992")
("v4990", "value", "v4991")
