("v5000", "type", "Sequence")
("v5001", "type", "String")
("v5001", "scalar", "The recursion does not end through the discovery of a reviewer who cannot be wrong. It can end, provisionally, at a boundary of jurisdiction. A mechanism may govern a particular office or resource without claiming the right to govern every route by which people resist it. Some evidence can remain elsewhere. Some resources can remain outside its accounts. Some people can refuse its process. Some decisions can expire unless renewed. Some losses can count against it without being reinterpreted as proof of its sophistication.")
("v5000", "item", "v5001")
("v4999", "value", "v5000")
("v4800", "item", "v4994")
