("v5009", "type", "Sequence")
("v5010", "type", "String")
("v5010", "scalar", "These are practical limits, not a promise of purity. Outside actors can be mistaken, malicious, or captured by other interests. A rival institution can reproduce the same hierarchy. Still, a framework that permits several routes of challenge can sometimes be defeated in ways that a framework with one authoritative account of defeat cannot. The work becomes identifying where those routes exist, what they cost, and whether they are closing.")
("v5009", "item", "v5010")
("v5008", "value", "v5009")
