("v5026", "type", "String")
("v5026", "scalar", "The phrase independent evidence needs the same discipline. Ten reports generated from one administrative database are not ten independent confirmations. A simulation, its graph, its summary, and an article explaining it remain one causal evidence family. More formats can improve inspection; they do not create more observations. The present article inherits that limitation from the model it discusses.")
("v5025", "item", "v5026")
("v5024", "value", "v5025")
