("v5095", "type", "Sequence")
("v5096", "type", "String")
("v5096", "scalar", "Where, then, does the recursion end? It has no universal terminal level at which power becomes harmless. The practical stopping point is a bounded arrangement that makes a limited commitment, exposes its failure conditions, and leaves material routes by which others can reject or replace it. That arrangement remains corrigible only while those routes remain usable. Its openness is a condition that can deteriorate, not a title it earns forever.")
("v5095", "item", "v5096")
("v5094", "value", "v5095")
("v5088", "item", "v5089")
("v5097", "type", "String")
("v5097", "scalar", "\n")
("v5088", "item", "v5097")
("v5098", "type", "Record")
("v5098", "entry", "v5099")
("v5099", "type", "Entry")
("v5099", "key", "tag")
("v5100", "type", "String")
("v5100", "scalar", "p")
("v5099", "value", "v5100")
("v5098", "entry", "v5101")
("v5101", "type", "Entry")
("v5101", "key", "attrs")
("v5102", "type", "Record")
("v5101", "value", "v5102")
("v5098", "entry", "v5103")
("v5103", "type", "Entry")
("v5103", "key", "children")
("v5104", "type", "Sequence")
("v5105", "type", "String")
("v5105", "scalar", "There is a difference between admitting that no arrangement is finally guaranteed and concluding that all arrangements are equally closed. A complaint backed by resources, evidence, usable alternatives, and an enforceable route is materially different from an invitation to speak at the pleasure of the person complained about. A reserve is different from a promise. A revocable delegation is different from an office that can define every attempted revocation as illegitimate. The absence of perfection does not erase these distinctions.")
("v5104", "item", "v5105")
("v5103", "value", "v5104")
("v5088", "item", "v5098")
("v5106", "type", "String")
("v5106", "scalar", "\n")
("v5088", "item", "v5106")
("v5107", "type", "Record")
("v5107", "entry", "v5108")
("v5108", "type", "Entry")
("v5108", "key", "tag")
("v5109", "type", "String")
("v5109", "scalar", "p")
("v5108", "value", "v5109")
("v5107", "entry", "v5110")
("v5110", "type", "Entry")
("v5110", "key", "attrs")
("v5111", "type", "Record")
("v5110", "value", "v5111")
("v5107", "entry", "v5112")
("v5112", "type", "Entry")
("v5112", "key", "children")
("v5113", "type", "Sequence")
("v5114", "type", "String")
("v5114", "scalar", "The proposal I want to keep is limited: before celebrating a remedy, ask what it leaves people able to do when that remedy goes wrong. A correction margin can help make one part of that question explicit. Its rate can draw attention to an opportunity that is closing. Neither quantity can decide the whole situation or confer authority over the person whose circumstances it describes.")
("v5113", "item", "v5114")
("v5112", "value", "v5113")
("v5088", "item", "v5107")
("v5115", "type", "String")
("v5115", "scalar", "\n")
("v5088", "item", "v5115")
("v5116", "type", "Record")
("v5116", "entry", "v5117")
("v5117", "type", "Entry")
("v5117", "key", "tag")
("v5118", "type", "String")
("v5118", "scalar", "p")
("v5117", "value", "v5118")
