("v5277", "type", "String")
("v5277", "scalar", "The comparison uses two authored cooperation rules and two initial cases. Case A starts with no outside reserve and a patronage share of 0.1. Case B starts with an outside reserve of 4 and a patronage share of 0.3. Both start at dependence midpoints of 0.25 and 0.45. The separate intervention fund contains two material tokens for every policy.")
("v5276", "item", "v5277")
("v5275", "value", "v5276")
("v5243", "item", "v5270")
("v5278", "type", "Record")
("v5278", "entry", "v5279")
("v5279", "type", "Entry")
("v5279", "key", "tag")
("v5280", "type", "String")
("v5280", "scalar", "p")
("v5279", "value", "v5280")
("v5278", "entry", "v5281")
("v5281", "type", "Entry")
("v5281", "key", "attrs")
("v5282", "type", "Record")
("v5281", "value", "v5282")
("v5278", "entry", "v5283")
("v5283", "type", "Entry")
("v5283", "key", "children")
("v5284", "type", "Sequence")
("v5285", "type", "String")
("v5285", "scalar", "Six illustrative intervals define the uncertainty box: an unknown-expectation fallback of 0.49–0.51; the two groups’ initial dependence of 0.23–0.27 and 0.43–0.47; hearing cost of 0.45–0.55; a patronage-to-blocking multiplier of 1.8–2.2; and a switching-cost coefficient of 0.45–0.55. These are authored ranges, not confidence intervals. Unlisted coefficients and evidence-update rules remain fixed.")
("v5284", "item", "v5285")
("v5283", "value", "v5284")
