("v5292", "type", "Sequence")
("v5293", "type", "String")
("v5293", "scalar", "Each axis is evaluated at its endpoints and midpoint, giving 729 parameter tuples. The tuple and cooperation law remain fixed while relationships and resources evolve. Seven policies, two cases, and two rules yield 20,412 trajectories, each lasting 12 synthetic periods. The primary criterion requires immediately available capacity for a further hearing and sufficient coordination after every period, each above its separate 0.05 floor. Recovery after delayed delivery is a different outcome.")
("v5292", "item", "v5293")
("v5291", "value", "v5292")
